 "caption": "For x = t², y = ⅔t³ the speed is √((dx/dt)² + (dy/dt)²) = 2t√(1 + t²). The curve's length for 0 ≤ t ≤ 1 is the area under this speed graph: (2/3)(2√2 − 1) ≈ 1.219.",
